sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Faculty / Administrator
    participant Browser as Admin Web Portal
    participant Filter as AuthorizationFilter (ROLE_ADMIN)
    participant AdminServlet as AdminServlet
    participant AcadSvc as AcademicService
    participant AnnSvc as AnnouncementService
    participant AuditSvc as AuditService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over Admin, DB: Academic Structure Management
    Admin->>Browser: Opens Subject Management & Clicks "Create Subject"
    Browser->>Filter: POST /admin/subjects/create (CSRF Token)
    Filter->>AdminServlet: Authorize & Route
    AdminServlet->>AcadSvc: createSubject(name, code, courseId, semesterId)
    AcadSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO subjects (name, code, course_id, semester_id, is_active)
    DB-->>AcadSvc: Subject Created (id=15)
    AcadSvc->>AuditSvc: logActivity(adminId, "CREATE_SUBJECT", "id=15", ip)
    AuditSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs
    AcadSvc-->>AdminServlet: Success
    AdminServlet-->>Browser: Redirect with Flash Success Message

    Note over Admin, DB: Publishing Announcements
    Admin->>Browser: Fills Announcement Form (Title, Body, Target Course)
    Browser->>Filter: POST /admin/announcements/create (CSRF Token)
    Filter->>AdminServlet: Authorize & Route
    AdminServlet->>AnnSvc: publishAnnouncement(adminId, title, content, targetCourseId, priority)
    AnnSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO announcements
    AnnSvc->>DB: Bulk INSERT INTO notifications for enrolled students
    AnnSvc->>AuditSvc: logActivity(adminId, "CREATE_ANNOUNCEMENT", title, ip)
    AdminServlet-->>Browser: Redirect to announcements listing with confirmation

